OL,5,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,6,     FAdam Hickox conducts the Royal
OL,7,     FLiverpool Philharmonic Orchestra
OL,8,     Fin a concert that features
OL,9,     FStravinsky's groundbreaking ballet
OL,10,     FThe Rite of Spring and a new work
OL,11,     Fby Gavin Higgins.
OL,12,G2145 The Essay: Solo
OL,13,     FA soloist prepares to play a
OL,14,     Fcelebrated piece of classical
OL,15,     Frepertoire. Guitarist Sean Shibe
OL,16,     Frehearses Rodrigo's Three Spanish
OL,17,     FPieces.
